        "desc": "Enforce defense in depth: enable **S3 Block Public Access** at org/account and bucket levels (`BlockPublicAcls`, `IgnorePublicAcls`, `BlockPublicPolicy`, `RestrictPublicBuckets`). Apply **least privilege** with explicit principals; avoid ACLs via Object Ownership. Use private access patterns (e.g., CloudFront OAC or presigned URLs) and monitor with analyzers.",
